        <item>
            <title>0.8.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:25:45 +1100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mattdoran/quill</link>
            <sparkle:version>127</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Quill 0.8.0

**Separate Voices**
- More accurate. You may see one extra voice.
- If two voices are the same person, give both the same name and save. To undo, click **Not the Same Person**.

**Other changes**
- Opening a second transcript window no longer stops the first from saving names or closing.
- The "Meeting detected" prompt now stays until you respond or the call ends.
- Detects calls in more apps, including Zoom Phone, Webex, Aircall and 8x8 Work.

[Full changelog](https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/compare/v0.7.0...v0.8.0)

]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/releases/download/v0.8.0/Quill-0.8.0.zip" length="4928340" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Al74LRODQY76R+u01wsx/iem5Tw+95edwc9TPOzD/1cBWZH/mj/Bgi5hgKQ+2xDedRD+YzJeznx52ryAHvvtCQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.7.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:40:48 +1000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mattdoran/quill</link>
            <sparkle:version>113</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Quill 0.7.0

- Quill's menu bar icon now stays visible with Bartender on macOS 27, as long as Quill is in your Applications folder. If you installed from the disk image, it already is.
- The Transcript window keeps your scroll position and any selected text when it refreshes, for example after **Save Names**.

[Full changelog](https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/compare/v0.6.0...v0.7.0)

]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/releases/download/v0.7.0/Quill-0.7.0.zip" length="4905994" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="z1tTLE1BrA0NxhpxzE+ZMzL74uOXDqbluAS7ByYAD2e1FOZnepMNPgs7sq/BYwctgB6oLy9sDr5Db1jG2YeBCg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 09:04:58 +1000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mattdoran/quill</link>
            <sparkle:version>107</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Quill 0.6.0

**Remember Voice**
- Click **Remember Voice** to save a speaker's name and voice on this Mac.
- In later meetings, if an unnamed voice sounds like someone you saved, such as Alice, click **Use Alice** to fill in the name.
- **Forget Remembered Voices…** removes them all. Names already in transcripts stay.

**Other changes**
- **Separate Voices…** now separates Local and Remote voices together. Under "How many people spoke?", change either or both.
- **Copy Markdown** (Shift-Command-C) copies the whole transcript with speaker names and times.

[Full changelog](https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/compare/v0.5.0...v0.6.0)

]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/releases/download/v0.6.0/Quill-0.6.0.zip" length="4904007" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="UkzBl/iJRhar5QqcZdOzOjgtsDGF87QK4BSQ7g09RkNvWLr5Xpg7Lnwgvth12cZ1PP64YsDCFIoFiWjtonYDBg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 14:18:09 +1000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mattdoran/quill</link>
            <sparkle:version>102</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Quill 0.5.0

**Meeting companion**
- Recordings started from "Meeting detected" now stop 20 seconds after the meeting ends, unless you click **Keep Recording**.
- If the companion isn't showing, you'll get a "Meeting ended?" notification.
- Remembers where you drag it, even after restarting Quill.

**Other changes**
- While a Quill window is open, Quill shows in the Dock and Command-Tab.
- To bring it back, choose **Show Quill Window** from the menu bar icon.

[Full changelog](https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/compare/v0.4.0...v0.5.0)

]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/mattdoran/quill/releases/download/v0.5.0/Quill-0.5.0.zip" length="4875525" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="wnG0bR+BiqSLMKxHBrpHF1buwL7wYNvWRfmrpRQinCrbf0N9qI3Q9TM04aDGvnwA2i1txT7XWFgP7HHoqXhlCA=="/>
